    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
keywords:
  - decentralized finance
  - algorithmic trading
  - reproducibility
  - reject inference
  - benchmark dataset
  - event identity model
notes: >
  v1.0.0 (2026-06-05) is kept as a git tag to reproduce v1-era outputs;
  cite v2 for per-event results. v2 also adds an independent test oracle
  at tests/oracle.py.
